        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "10/10. I Recommend for everyone home owner in need of a paint job to reach out to Peinture JDP.\nThe job was very well done anD the staff was super friendly.\nBonus, I didn't have to do it myself, and that's a win in my book.\nThanks Again.",
