      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rex Brynen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104594176065316285939/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJuQi2bxtb_Fq1or09clyzEim03ng5LFSNezhEAi-l30Cpeo4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Julien has done painting work for us twice now, and we've been very pleased with the quality.",
        "time": 1756294182,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexane Poirier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118336748863534284327/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhy6zKDtUo1ZIrjN_LQZQbwnMCPxsK1fuWgKDnZoduOLuY4FHn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I did business with Julien for a makeover of my home. I received great, professional and courteous service! Work well done, efficient and no paint drops on my floor (as I have experienced with other companies). Several members of my family have also done business with him for various projects (house, cottage, etc.). I recommend him 100%!",
        "time": 1756214689,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marie-Laurence Fortin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100666566606747335028/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLV1eBgu_OWhF0ONTjaQ4e1-PmGMDelBgO_euLoYR-JfOOzHQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Julien and Peinture JDP for any interior or exterior painting project. Their work is remarkable: efficient while being precise, neat and carried out with great attention to detail. The team also distinguished itself by its professionalism, punctuality and respect for deadlines. I am delighted with the result and will not hesitate to use their services again!",
        "time": 1757602148,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Yanic Belanger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114279867621494693175/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbhcPg1tpdnoEA04CSi0LRi0wO8d1HHfUdNtBhWTwp_PUMag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "We received excellent service from JDP Painting. Julien and Yanick are very kind and professional. They were able to adapt to our needs and requests. We highly recommend them. :)",
